{"seq":3,"slug":"debugging-orthogonality","title":"线路调试与正交性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/circuits/debugging-orthogonality","wordCount":1456,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"线路调试与正交性\">线路调试与正交性</h1><p>一个在纸上完美的逻辑门，装进活细胞后输出却一片混乱——这是几乎每个合成生物学者都经历过的挫败。问题往往不出在设计的逻辑本身，而出在「上下文」：你设计的线路并非运行在真空里，而是寄生在一个早已忙碌不堪的细胞中，与宿主争夺资源、被宿主的分子无意干扰。本篇把这些麻烦归类，讲清楚<strong>正交性</strong>为什么是对治之道，以及一套系统的调试方法。它直接回应 <a href=\"../foundations/engineering-paradigm\">合成生物学的工程范式</a> 提出的「上下文依赖性」难题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-失效的三类来源\">核心概念：失效的三类来源</h2><p>线路不工作时，故障通常来自三个层面，对症下药前必须先定位是哪一类。<strong>串扰</strong>（crosstalk）指本应独立的信号通道之间发生了意外耦合，比如一个抑制子误结合了不该结合的启动子。<strong>资源竞争</strong>（resource competition）指线路与宿主、或线路各部分之间争夺有限的 RNA 聚合酶、核糖体、tRNA，导致一个模块的开启会莫名压低另一个模块。<strong>负载效应</strong>（load / burden）指外源线路消耗细胞资源拖慢生长，进而触发突变逃逸或表达漂移。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    F[&quot;线路输出异常&quot;] --&gt; C1[&quot;串扰&lt;br/&gt;信号通道意外耦合&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; C2[&quot;资源竞争&lt;br/&gt;聚合酶/核糖体争夺&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; C3[&quot;负载效应&lt;br/&gt;拖慢生长/突变逃逸&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; S1[&quot;对策:正交元件&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; S2[&quot;对策:正交资源池&quot;]&#10;    C3 --&gt; S3[&quot;对策:降负载/动态调控&quot;]\">graph TD\n    F[\"线路输出异常\"] --&gt; C1[\"串扰&lt;br/&gt;信号通道意外耦合\"]\n    F --&gt; C2[\"资源竞争&lt;br/&gt;聚合酶/核糖体争夺\"]\n    F --&gt; C3[\"负载效应&lt;br/&gt;拖慢生长/突变逃逸\"]\n    C1 --&gt; S1[\"对策:正交元件\"]\n    C2 --&gt; S2[\"对策:正交资源池\"]\n    C3 --&gt; S3[\"对策:降负载/动态调控\"]</pre><p>这三类故障的共同根源，是人工线路与宿主细胞共享同一套分子资源和分子识别空间。正交性的全部意义，就是在这两个共享空间里为人工线路「划出专属车道」，让它与宿主互不干扰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正交性的两个维度\">正交性的两个维度</h2><p>「正交」一词借自数学中的「互不相关」，在合成生物学里它有两个独立的维度，下表区分了它们。理解这两层，才能选对正交化策略。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>正交维度</th>\n<th>划出的「专属车道」</th>\n<th>代表手段</th>\n<th>对治的故障</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>识别正交</td>\n<td>分子识别空间</td>\n<td>正交抑制子/启动子对、CRISPR guide RNA</td>\n<td>串扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源正交</td>\n<td>分子资源池</td>\n<td>T7 RNA 聚合酶、正交核糖体（o-ribosome）</td>\n<td>资源竞争</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>识别正交保证「A 抑制子只认 A 启动子」，互不误伤。最强大的识别正交工具是 CRISPR：只要更换 guide RNA 序列，就能生成几乎无限多对互不串扰的调控关系，这也是 <a href=\"switches-logic-gates\">基因开关与逻辑门</a> 中逻辑扩展得以突破天然转录因子数量限制的原因（CRISPR 原理见 <a href=\"../enabling-tech/crispr-editing\">基因编辑 CRISPR</a>）。资源正交则保证人工线路用自己专属的「工具」——例如 T7 噬菌体的 RNA 聚合酶只转录 T7 启动子，不与宿主转录机器争抢，正交核糖体（o-ribosome）只翻译带专属 RBS 的 mRNA。两个维度往往要同时做，才能让线路行为接近可加可预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量化负载-看不见的限速器\">量化负载:看不见的限速器</h2><p>负载效应最隐蔽，因为它不表现为「逻辑错」，而表现为「全线变弱、随时间漂移」。当外源线路大量表达时，它从有限的核糖体池里抽走份额，导致所有蛋白（包括宿主必需蛋白）的产量下降。这种竞争可以用一个简化模型刻画：若总核糖体数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tot</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{tot}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，某蛋白的合成速率正比于它能抢到的核糖体份额，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tot</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi_i \\propto R_{\\text{tot}} \\cdot \\frac{d_i}{\\sum_j d_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4933em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 mRNA <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的核糖体需求。这个分式结构揭示了一个反直觉的后果：增强一个基因的表达（提高其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），会按比例压低所有其它基因的表达——模块之间通过分母「隐性耦合」了。这解释了为什么两个各自调试好的模块拼在一起常常双双失灵。</p>\n<p>应对负载有三招：降低不必要的高表达、使用动态调控让线路只在需要时开启、以及选用更宽裕的 <a href=\"../enabling-tech/chassis-minimal-genome\">底盘细胞与最小基因组</a>。最小基因组底盘因为删去了大量非必需基因，理论上能把更多资源让给人工线路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"系统化调试流程\">系统化调试流程</h2><p>面对失效线路，凭直觉乱改是低效的；一套受 <a href=\"../foundations/dbtl-cycle\">设计-构建-测试-学习循环</a> 启发的系统流程能快速收敛。核心思想是「分而治之 + 定量观测」：把线路拆成可单独测试的子模块，逐个验证其传递函数是否符合预期，再逐步组装并在每一步检查是否出现新的串扰或负载。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    M[&quot;可疑线路&quot;] --&gt; SPLIT[&quot;拆成子模块&quot;]&#10;    SPLIT --&gt; TEST[&quot;逐模块测传递函数&quot;]&#10;    TEST --&gt; OK{符合预期?}&#10;    OK --&gt;|否| FIX1[&quot;换正交元件/调强度&quot;]&#10;    OK --&gt;|是| COMB[&quot;两两组装&quot;]&#10;    COMB --&gt; CHK{出现新串扰/负载?}&#10;    CHK --&gt;|是| FIX2[&quot;插绝缘子/降负载&quot;]&#10;    CHK --&gt;|否| FULL[&quot;全线路集成&quot;]&#10;    FIX1 --&gt; TEST&#10;    FIX2 --&gt; COMB\">flowchart TD\n    M[\"可疑线路\"] --&gt; SPLIT[\"拆成子模块\"]\n    SPLIT --&gt; TEST[\"逐模块测传递函数\"]\n    TEST --&gt; OK{符合预期?}\n    OK --&gt;|否| FIX1[\"换正交元件/调强度\"]\n    OK --&gt;|是| COMB[\"两两组装\"]\n    COMB --&gt; CHK{出现新串扰/负载?}\n    CHK --&gt;|是| FIX2[\"插绝缘子/降负载\"]\n    CHK --&gt;|否| FULL[\"全线路集成\"]\n    FIX1 --&gt; TEST\n    FIX2 --&gt; COMB</pre><p>调试时有几件「利器」值得专门提及：<strong>绝缘子</strong>（insulator，如自切割核酶 RBS）能消除元件间的上下文耦合，让 RBS 强度不再受上游序列影响；<strong>负载报告器</strong>（capacity monitor）用一个组成型荧光蛋白实时反映宿主剩余资源，把不可见的负载变成可读数据。把这些工具与定量测量结合，调试就从玄学变成了工程。可靠运行的线路是一切下游应用的前提——无论是 <a href=\"../applications/metabolic-engineering\">代谢工程与生物制造</a> 还是 <a href=\"../applications/biosensing-diagnostics\">生物传感与诊断</a>，都依赖线路在真实宿主里行为可预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>线路失效有三类来源：<strong>串扰</strong>（信号耦合）、<strong>资源竞争</strong>（争夺聚合酶/核糖体）、<strong>负载效应</strong>（拖慢生长与漂移）。</li>\n<li>正交性有两个维度：<strong>识别正交</strong>（专属分子识别，CRISPR 是最强工具）与<strong>资源正交</strong>（专属聚合酶/核糖体）。</li>\n<li>负载通过核糖体份额公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tot</mtext></msub><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi_i \\propto R_{\\text{tot}} d_i/\\sum_j d_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把模块<strong>隐性耦合</strong>：增强一个基因会压低其余所有基因。</li>\n<li>应对负载靠降表达、动态调控与宽裕的最小基因组底盘。</li>\n<li>系统化调试遵循「分而治之 + 定量观测」，并善用<strong>绝缘子</strong>消除上下文耦合、<strong>负载报告器</strong>让负载可见。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线路调试与正交性","id":"线路调试与正交性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：失效的三类来源","id":"核心概念-失效的三类来源"},{"level":2,"text":"正交性的两个维度","id":"正交性的两个维度"},{"level":2,"text":"量化负载:看不见的限速器","id":"量化负载-看不见的限速器"},{"level":2,"text":"系统化调试流程","id":"系统化调试流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"振荡器与反馈线路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/circuits/oscillators-feedback"},"next":{"title":"DNA 合成与组装","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/enabling-tech/dna-synthesis-assembly"}}